  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHw/452",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">추석을 맞이하여 5일이나 되는 연휴동안 아이들이 &#39;별&#39;에 대한 관심을 잃을까 두려워 ㅎㅎ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">(저는 VII단원 별과 우주 수업 중입니다..)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>추석맞이 천체사진 촬영 콘테스트</b></span>를 진행해봅니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">강제성은 전혀 없고 희망학생만 온라인수업에 활용되고 있는 오픈채팅방에 학번+이름+사진을 올려달라고 했습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">추석은 음력으로 보름인 시기라 대도시에서 별을 관찰하기가 힘들겠지만 혹시나 시골에 가는 학생들이 있으면 도전하지 않을까 싶어서 담임선생님들께 홍보를 부탁드렸습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">연휴 끝나고 몇 장이나 올지 기대와 우려가 동시에... ㅎㅎㅎ</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">* 학급 홍보물은 첨부된 PPT 파일을 플로터를 이용하여 1~4 페이지를 A3 사이즈로 모아찍기 출력하여 학급에 게시하였습니다. ^^</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b93b9bc68004e64c6a0885221a8ce964dbc0caef?download\" data-file-name=\"추석에 놀면 뭐하니.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2393102\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D452%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20200928154629&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb93b9bc68004e64c6a0885221a8ce964dbc0caef')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">추석에 놀면 뭐하니</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.28MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66e67132a36d3c853a32d46c07985e19e80db12b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66e67132a36d3c853a32d46c07985e19e80db12b\" data-orgin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a64ec02357719b25a65def7eae6915dfda9e3ce9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a64ec02357719b25a65def7eae6915dfda9e3ce9\" data-orgin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/622d51d1e68865b8f3973db02e524ca254fa7a55\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/622d51d1e68865b8f3973db02e524ca254fa7a55\" data-orgin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14df9b1a389e0c8e6fb7d00e0f6ce9916217ca62\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14df9b1a389e0c8e6fb7d00e0f6ce9916217ca62\" data-orgin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;폰트 출처&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://noonnu.cc/font_page/376\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">noonnu.cc/font_page/376</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
